seed.push({id:'DEV-061',title:'Configurable Mola funding approval rules',area:'Approvals',kind:'Task',status:'Ready to test',priority:'High',release:'MVP',owner:'',due:'',dependencies:'DEV-056',description:'Allow the owner to configure the required distinct founder approvals and designated approver list. Keep rule history and require fresh review for requests with approvals under changed rules.',criteria:'Owner-only changes with stale-version protection and recorded decision/change reason.\nRequire at least two approvals and a sufficient set of distinct founder slots.\nConfigured approvers need active linked accounts; owner status alone is not approval permission.\nRequester self-approval remains blocked.\nA threshold or designated-list change invalidates earlier approval snapshots.\nKeep the existing pilot rule until an explicit configuration save.\nDisplay insufficient available approvers clearly.\nThese are internal funding rules, separate from weighted investment votes and bank execution.',notes:'2026-09-29: Implemented owner-only threshold and designated-founder configuration under Funding requests, with reason, acknowledgement, immediate effective time, history and stale-version protection. Configured rules remove implicit owner/officer approval rights and require active linked selected founders. Rule changes invalidate existing approval snapshots; request details show insufficient capacity. New policy tests plus existing funding and eight-scenario pilot regressions passed; TypeScript passed. Browser acceptance pending. No live rule was changed and both sites remain owner-private.',version:1,updated:'2026-09-29T11:23:00.000Z'});

seed.push({id:'DEV-062',title:'Governance decision register',area:'Ownership',kind:'Task',status:'Ready to test',priority:'High',release:'MVP',owner:'',due:'',dependencies:'DEV-016, DEV-017, DEV-061',description:'Record valuation, ownership-unit, weighted-voting, and reserved-decision proposals or group-adopted decisions without activating financial mechanics automatically.',criteria:'Owner can record draft, proposed, adopted, and superseded decision records.\nRequire type, date, meeting/reference, and decision text.\nShow adopted records with a clear implementation caveat.\nKeep valuation, ownership, and voting calculations unchanged until a separate implementation policy is approved and built.\nFilter the register by status.\nKeep decision data isolated to Mola and owner-private.',notes:'2026-09-29: Implemented the Mola governance decision register. It records group decisions without inventing a valuation, issuing units, changing voting weights, changing approval thresholds, or moving money. TypeScript and focused API tests passed; browser acceptance pending.',version:1,updated:'2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z'});

seed.push({id:'DEV-060',title:'Mola member statements and CSV download',area:'Contributions',kind:'Task',status:'Ready to test',priority:'High',release:'MVP',owner:'',due:'',dependencies:'DEV-057, DEV-059',description:'Give each Mola member a statement with verified/pending/owner-reconciled totals, remaining and overdue obligations, unallocated reviewed payments, payment and correction history, and a downloadable date-range CSV.',criteria:'Default to all recorded dates; filter payments by payment date and obligations by due date, inclusively.\nShow current review status, not a reconstructed historical balance.\nCurrent credits from outside the date range still reduce selected obligations.\nSeparate every currency and keep provisional owner amounts distinct.\nUnallocated contributions do not automatically cover future dues or imply issued ownership.\nExport the same filtered records and all their review history, safely escaping spreadsheet formulas.\nTest corrections, excess credits, empty ranges and cross-member/currency isolation.\nKeep the workspace owner-private.',notes:'2026-09-29: Implemented a Mola Statements view with member/date selection, per-currency status totals, remaining/overdue obligations, unallocated verified and provisional payments, record links, full review history and CSV download. Calculations use current loaded status; the range filters payment/due dates, not historical review state. Focused tests passed for inclusive dates, outside-range credits, corrections, excess credits, isolation, decimal exports and spreadsheet formula escaping. TypeScript passed. Browser/mobile download acceptance remains pending. Owner-private; no live records changed.',version:1,updated:'2026-09-29T11:13:00.000Z'});

seed.push({id:'DEV-059',title:'Contribution register search and filters',area:'Contributions',kind:'Task',status:'Ready to test',priority:'Medium',release:'MVP',owner:'',due:'',dependencies:'DEV-057',description:'Make the contribution register easier to use with member/status/currency/date filters, search, sorting and separate displayed totals for pending, verified and owner-reconciled records.',criteria:'Search by member, contribution label and payment reference.\nCombine member, status, currency and inclusive payment-date filters.\nKeep currencies separate and label totals as filtered payment records, not treasury cash.\nReset filters and distinguish no matching records from an empty register.\nOpen existing review/details from a filtered result.\nSwitch organizations without carrying filters across.\nCheck phone layout and keyboard controls.',notes:'2026-09-29: Implemented combined search, member/status/currency/date filters, newest/oldest ordering, clear/reset states and 50-row progressive display. Pending, verified and owner-reconciled summaries cover all matching records with separate currencies and explicit non-cash labeling. TypeScript checks passed; browser/phone acceptance remains pending. Existing detail and review flows are retained. No financial records or verification rules changed.',version:1,updated:'2026-09-29T10:55:00.000Z'});

