seed.push({id:'DEV-058',title:'Owner browser and phone acceptance checklist',area:'Experience',kind:'Test',status:'Ready to test',priority:'High',release:'MVP',owner:'',due:'',dependencies:'DEV-055, DEV-056, DEV-057',description:'Check the published owner-private workspace on desktop and phone before real-member testing. This task has not yet been executed in a browser.',criteria:'Open every Mola section and switch organizations; confirm the correct names and records are shown.\nOn phone, open/close the sidebar and scroll member tables; amounts, status labels and actions remain reachable.\nOpen contribution, member, weekly-dues, account and funding forms; cancel without saving and confirm records are unchanged.\nIn Projects, preview dues without generating; confirm per-member amounts, dates and group total.\nOpen an Activity record and compare its displayed member, amount and current status.\nFor an existing test funding request, inspect current approvals and archived versions; cancel any edit.\nRefresh the workspace and confirm records remain consistent.\nRecord device, outcome and reproduction steps for any failure. Do not mark Done without actual browser evidence.',notes:'Manual acceptance remains pending. No need to invite founders or alter site sharing to run these owner-only checks. Use existing records read-only; creating test records on the live workspace requires a deliberate separate test cycle.',version:1,updated:'2026-09-29T10:35:00.000Z'});

